Sek,K (2446)-Tari,A (2634) Wch Rapid Moscow 2019 (12)})) 13. Bg3 Bd6 14. d4 $5 Bxg3 15. hxg3 $44) 10. Nxd4 $1 Bxd1 (10... Bxd4 11. Rdf1 $36 {[%cal Gh2h3,Gc3e2,Gf4g5,Gg2g4] A lot of ideas.}) 11. Nf5 $1 Bg4 12. Nxg7 $3 {[%csl Bg7]} Kxg7 13. Bg5 {[%cal Gh1f1] Rf1 is coming, and Black's position is very dangerous.} Bd4 (13... Be6 14. Rf1 Bd4 {transposes to 13...Bd4.} (14... Ng4 15. Bxd8 Be3 16. Bxc7 Bxd2+ 17. Kxd2 Bxc4 18. dxc4 Rac8 19. Nd5 Rfe8 {[%csl Be8]} 20. Rf4 Ne5 21. b3 Re6 22. Ba5 $36 {[%cal Ga5c3] Bc3 next, with a strong initiative because our pieces are dominating the board.})) (13... h6 14. Bxh6+ Kh7 15. d4 d5 $1 {[%csl Bd5]} 16. exd5 Ng8 $1 {[%csl Bg8] Only move.} 17. Bd3+ f5 18. Bxf8 Bxf8 19. Kb1 $36 {[%cal Gh2h3,Gg2g4] Three pawns for the piece plus we have h3-g4 ideas.}) 14. Rf1 Be6 {[%csl Be6] Only move.} 15. Ne2 $1 {[%cal Ge2g3,Gg3h5] with the idea Ng3-Nh5.} (15. e5 {[%cal Gc3e4] Looks logical, with the idea Ne4, but Black has a strong defensive idea:} Ng4 $1 {[%csl Bg4]} 16. Bxd8 Be3 17. Bxc7 Bxd2+ 18. Kxd2 Bxc4 19. dxc4 Nxe5 20. b3 $36 {[%cal Gc3d5] Nd5 next. We have more than full compensation for the exchange.}) 15... Be5 16. Ng3 Kh8 $3 17. d4 $1 (17. Nh5 $2 {[%csl Rh5]} Nxe4 $19 {[%csl Be4]}) 17... Nxe4 18. Nxe4 f6 19. Bxe6 fxg5 20. Rxf8+ Qxf8 21. dxe5 Qf1+ 22. Qd1 Qf4+ 23. Nd2 Qxe5 24. Bc4 $14 *

